---
source: crates/rustman-cli/src/tests.rs
expression: help
---
Fetch an endpoint's schema by introspection and cache it (optionally writing it as SDL)

Usage: rustman graphql introspect [OPTIONS] <ENDPOINT|REQUEST>

Arguments:
  <ENDPOINT|REQUEST>
          An endpoint URL, or a graphql request file, its id or its name

Options:
      --out <FILE>
          Also write the schema as SDL to FILE

      --env <NAME>
          Environment (default: RUSTMAN_ENV, then default_environment)

      --workspace <DIR>
          Workspace directory (default: search from the current directory upwards)

      --var <K=V>
          Set a variable, above every other source (repeatable): --var k=v

      --timeout <DURATION>
          Total timeout: 500ms, 5s, 2m, or a number of milliseconds

  -k, --insecure
          Do not verify TLS certificates

      --color <WHEN>
          Color: auto (a terminal without NO_COLOR or TERM=dumb), always or never
          
          [default: auto]

  -v, --verbose...
          Log more on stderr: -v requests, -vv headers, -vvv everything (RUST_LOG, when set, replaces these levels)

  -h, --help
          Print help
